{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0042_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "8c3e103cf640aa055568c9188b5d9c1ea6590b3c89c17b3d9a91440f186dfc06", "ja": "よっしゃ！　今日は営業、はりきっていっくで～！\n私の魅力で、劇場のアピールもバッチリせなな！", "zh": "好！今天要干劲十足地工作喔～！\n我要用我的魅力，好好地推销剧场嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0042_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "b61d74917f05a9b67879d600eb98808a2cbbb22cd5f9f7dc61333cb5a93bebf6", "ja": "……ってことで、{$P$}さんも、\nよろしくお願いしますよ～？", "zh": "……所以{$P$}先生，\n也请你多多指教啦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0042_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b9ef8d232f576671e917fb4e650a8f614f93fd609094dc1d1c80945705e422f2", "ja": "ああ、よろしく……って奈緒、その意気込みは頼もしい\nけど、さっきまでノンビリ食べ歩きしてたよな？", "zh": "嗯，请多指教……我说奈绪，虽然这个宣言听起来很棒，\n但你直到刚才都在路上悠哉地吃东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0042_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "4224071b5f8cf6ebfdd1fe634e2c0268f7001e98270059bbcc53c2f4a4d13292", "ja": "そ、そうやったっけ～？　まあ、私はプライベートと\nオフの切り替えが、ちゃんとしてるってことかな～。", "zh": "有、有吗～？哎，意思就是\n我有好好区分私人时间和休假呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0042_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e7b2f47f14c93cc5e7349ef2e9b6578c9ed36cc53ab7176faaff2abc53f9579c", "ja": "なるほど。ま、『プライベート』と『オフ』だと、\n両方お休みって意味になるけどな！", "zh": "原来如此。不过『私人时间』和『休假』\n都是休息的意思喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0042_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "a94b249f221a5516326c6eb3efa26d6bee7f15a03a7dd67d6a145399873e8152", "ja": "う……、{$P$}さんのツッコミ、\n今日は冴えわたってるなぁ……。", "zh": "呜……{$P$}先生的吐嘈\n今天也很高明耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0042_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "6dc96176e581dd1a428169f30ed74cf8db0ee4fb525332e094ac4428d497961b", "ja": "私もボケとツッコミの街で生まれた人間として、\n負けてられへん。よし、改めて気持ち切り替えて……！", "zh": "我既然出生在装傻与吐嘈的城市，\n可不能输给你嘿。好，让我重新转换一下情绪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0042_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "946257b580fd76a0f02bb899869d4a218f4e982d90c762f5977d7af309bc6466", "ja": "ビシッと極めるわ、このお笑い道……ちゃうかった、\n今日のアイドル活動を！！", "zh": "我会在这条搞笑之路登峰造极……不对，\n我是说在今天的偶像活动！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
